      "description": "Faculty Scholarship and Research | Ohio State Lima Skip to main content Show Links OSU.edu Buckeye Link Map Webmail Search Ohio State Future Students Admissions Academic Enrichment Adjacent Housing Options Admissions Staff I'm Buckeye Bound: Admitted Students Orientation Request Information from Ohio State Lima Sign up to receive text alerts to your phone Transfer Students Majors and Programs Associates Degree Bachelor Degrees Minors Visit Academy - College Credit Plus Apply Late Registration Financial Aid Apply Cost of Attendance Financial Aid questions you need answered Financial Aid: Scholarships Financial Aid: Staff Financial Aid: Tuition Ohio State Grants Net Price Calculator Current Students Alumni Alumni Association Ohio State Lima Awards Alumni Awards Ohio State Lima Awards Nomination Form Transcripts Outreach Hire a Buckeye K-12 Outreach NWC Scholastic Bowl Tournament STEAM on the Quad STEM Steps Stardust: William A. Fowler Science Series WBL Scholastic Bowl Tournament Lifelong Learning Institute, LLI Speaker's Bureau WeServe WeServe Volunteer Opportunities WeServe Hours Portal Lima Outstanding Service Award Academics Departments Art Biology Classics Chemistry Communication Earth Sciences Economics Education Department of English Department of French Health Sciences Department of History Department of Mathematics Department of Music Philosophy Physics Department of Political Science Department of Psychology Department of Social Work Department of Theatre Academic Advising Adding Classes Campus Change from Lima to Columbus Dropping Classes Frequenty Asked Questions Meet the Advisors Scheduling Considerations Transfer Credit Information Welcome to Ohio State Lima Your Degree Audit Library Lima Class Schedules Research Faculty Scholarship Undergraduate Research Annual Research Mentorship Award Faculty Award for Sustained Student Mentorship Lima Undergraduate Research Forum Undergraduate Research: How do I get involved? Undergraduate Research Office Lima Regenerative Farm Impact of Giving Search Submit search Toggle search dialog Home Research At Ohio State Faculty Scholarship Faculty Scholarship Faculty Scholarship, Creative Output and Accomplishments At Ohio State Lima, you’ll discover world-class teachers passionate about connecting their knowledge and expertise to other disciplines as they discover new ways to see the world. The faculty at The Ohio State University aren't just talented, engaged teachers in the classroom, they are also world-class researchers, artists, and practitioners in their fields. The quality of research is truly what sets us apart - Ohio State Lima attracts talented scholars and top students. With faculty at the forefront of their discipline, their research helps shape the understanding of an enormous range of academic fields across 200+ majors at Ohio State. Faculty on the Lima campus have contributed in areas of study across every discipline including mathematical sciences to psychology, from philosophy to neural science, from artificial intelligence to sociology, theatre, and more.  The depth and breadth of scholarship work at Ohio State Lima is truly unique and translates to the experiences students receive in the classroom and labs. Read more Read more The Ohio State University Home The Ohio State University at Lima 4240 Campus Drive Lima, OH 45804 lima-webmaster@osu.edu Phone: 567-242-7272 Facebook\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external Instagram\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external X\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external LinkedIn\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external YouTube\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external TikTok\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external If you have a disability and experience difficulty accessing this content, please contact us . Privacy Statement Non-discrimination Notice Cookie Settings Site Map © 2026 The Ohio State University Back to top"
