      "title": "Research",
      "description": "Faculty Award for Sustained Student Mentorship | The Ohio State University Skip to main content Show Links OSU.edu Buckeye Link Map Webmail Search Ohio State Future Students Admissions Academic Enrichment Adjacent Housing Options Admissions Staff I'm Buckeye Bound: Admitted Students Orientation Request Information from Ohio State Lima Sign up to receive text alerts to your phone Transfer Students Majors and Programs Associates Degree Bachelor Degrees Minors Visit Academy - College Credit Plus Apply Late Registration Financial Aid Apply Cost of Attendance Financial Aid questions you need answered Financial Aid: Scholarships Financial Aid: Staff Financial Aid: Tuition Ohio State Grants Net Price Calculator Current Students Alumni Alumni Association Ohio State Lima Awards Alumni Awards Ohio State Lima Awards Nomination Form Transcripts Outreach Hire a Buckeye K-12 Outreach NWC Scholastic Bowl Tournament STEAM on the Quad STEM Steps Stardust: William A. Fowler Science Series WBL Scholastic Bowl Tournament Lifelong Learning Institute, LLI Speaker's Bureau WeServe WeServe Volunteer Opportunities WeServe Hours Portal Lima Outstanding Service Award Academics Departments Art Biology Classics Chemistry Communication Earth Sciences Economics Education Department of English Department of French Health Sciences Department of History Department of Mathematics Department of Music Philosophy Physics Department of Political Science Department of Psychology Department of Social Work Department of Theatre Academic Advising Adding Classes Campus Change from Lima to Columbus Dropping Classes Frequenty Asked Questions Meet the Advisors Scheduling Considerations Transfer Credit Information Welcome to Ohio State Lima Your Degree Audit Library Lima Class Schedules Research Faculty Scholarship Undergraduate Research Annual Research Mentorship Award Faculty Award for Sustained Student Mentorship Lima Undergraduate Research Forum Undergraduate Research: How do I get involved? Undergraduate Research Office Lima Regenerative Farm Impact of Giving Search Submit search Toggle search dialog Home Undergraduate Research Faculty Award For Sustained Student Mentorship Research Faculty Scholarship Undergraduate Research Annual Research Mentorship Award Faculty Award for Sustained Student Mentorship Lima Undergraduate Research Forum Undergraduate Research: How do I get involved? Undergraduate Research Office Lima Regenerative Farm Faculty Award for Sustained Student Mentorship Eligibility: Any member of the Ohio State Lima Faculty Assembly is eligible to receive this award. Article 1 of the Constitution of the Lima Campus Faculty Assembly defines the terms of membership in the Assembly. The URMC encourages applications from ALL DISCIPLINES. Given that the URMC evaluates project proposals from different areas and disciplines relative to their own, applicants are encouraged to include information in their application about any unique features of the project or particular obstacles within an area of study that would help inform committee members not familiar with the discipline about the merits of the project. Faculty Award for Sustained Student Mentorship Description: This award will be given on an annual basis for sustained excellence over several years (5 years or more) in undergraduate scholarly mentorship. Award: This award will include a $500 honorarium and $1,000 in the form of a line of credit that can be used for professional development (e.g., travel expenses, books, research or teaching materials or supplies). Only one award is given each year. The winner will be announced (and presented with a plaque) at the annual Spring Awards Ceremony. The funds can be accessed directly by using the P-card. For other options, including reimbursements, please contact the Business Office. Review: Nominations for the Ohio State Lima Faculty Award for Student Mentorship will be reviewed by the URMC. The committee will consider both the quantity and quality of student-mentored projects. Nomination forms are available on the URMC webpage. Self-nominations are acceptable and encouraged. Individuals who have previously won the award must sit out a period of five years before being considered again. Applications can be submitted here. Please direct questions to Tina Schneider, schneider.290@osu.edu . The Ohio State University Home The Ohio State University at Lima 4240 Campus Drive Lima, OH 45804 lima-webmaster@osu.edu Phone: 567-242-7272 Facebook\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external Instagram\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external X\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external LinkedIn\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external YouTube\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external TikTok\n        \t\t\t        \t\t\t\tprofile — external If you have a disability and experience difficulty accessing this content, please contact us . Privacy Statement Non-discrimination Notice Cookie Settings Site Map © 2026 The Ohio State University Back to top"
